{"title":"Lightning Shrine","slug":"Lightning_Shrine","hero":{"file":"ShrineInside.webp","width":400,"height":278},"pageid":4666,"revid":20442,"timestamp":"2025-11-08T23:42:52Z","lastEditor":"BetaProto","categories":["Locations","Stores"],"infobox":null,"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"},{"id":"gallery","text":"Gallery"}],"body":"<p>The <b>Lightning Shrine</b> is a crafting location behind <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Alan's_AutoLogistics/\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a> added in <span title=\"Secret Update 1.95.0 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2VjcmV0X1VwZGF0ZV8xLjk1LjA/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Secret Update 1.95.0</span>.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>This location is mainly used for crafting the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lightningbane/\">Lightningbane</a> pickaxe.\n</p><p>To access this location, you will need the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Michael's_Copper_Axe/\">Copper Axe</a>, and then you will need to approach the far obelisk during a thunderstorm while holding it. Once you are struck by lightning and the obelisk receives electricity, you will need to repeat this process with the remaining obelisks to unlock the passage.\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: A view of Alan's AutoLogistics, with the shrine circled in the back.\">A view of Alan's AutoLogistics, with the shrine circled in the back.</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: A view of Alan's AutoLogistics, with the shrine circled in the back.\">A view of Alan's AutoLogistics, with the shrine circled in the back.</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/LightningShrineLocation.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>A view of <b>Alan's AutoLogistics</b>, with the shrine circled in the back.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Lightning Shrine</b> can be found a short distance behind <b>Alan's AutoLogistics</b>.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>Some have reported that the shrine would not open despite all rods being activated. While this isn't explicitly confirmed, it's likely that it can only be opened once per server, making a singleplayer server recommended.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0d6d5e995330c40de17951751675ef2e\" data-seq-no=\"0\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"ShrineInside-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/ShrineInside.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The Shrine viewed from above\">The Shrine viewed from above</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The Shrine viewed from above\">The Shrine viewed from above</span></a></div></div><div>The Shrine viewed from above</div></div><div><div><div id=\"ShrineOutside-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/ShrineOutside.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The Cave underneath the shrine, showing the symbols for the required ingredients\">The Cave underneath the shrine, showing the symbols for the required ingredients</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The Cave underneath the shrine, showing the symbols for the required ingredients\">The Cave underneath the shrine, showing the symbols for the required ingredients</span></a></div></div><div>The Cave underneath the shrine, showing the symbols for the required ingredients</div></div><div><div><div id=\"Obelisk-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/Obelisk.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Inactive Lightning Rod\">Inactive Lightning Rod</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Inactive Lightning Rod\">Inactive Lightning Rod</span></a></div></div><div>Inactive Lightning Rod</div></div><div><div><div id=\"ActiveObelisk-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/ActiveObelisk.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Activated Lightning Rod\">Activated Lightning Rod</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Activated Lightning Rod\">Activated Lightning Rod</span></a></div></div><div>Activated Lightning Rod</div></div></div>"}
